<section class="module-landing-banner mb-5" style="--hero-bg: url('../images/heroes/hero-erp.jpg');" aria-label="Introduction">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="module-landing-accent" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <p class="module-landing-kicker mb-2">Enterprise Resource Planning</p>
        <h1 class="module-landing-headline text-white mb-3">Unified Operations for Enterprise Growth.</h1>
        <p class="module-landing-dek mb-4 col-lg-10 px-0">
            A single system of record that centralizes all core business operations—from financial control 
            and procurement to inventory management and project delivery—providing the real-time 
            visibility needed for enterprise-scale growth.
        </p>
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <a href="#components" class="btn btn-light btn-sm px-4 fw-semibold">Module components</a>
            <a href="/#inquiry" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-sm px-4">Start a conversation</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<div class="row mb-5" id="components">

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Module Components</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
            The ERP system comprises integrated components that work together to provide complete 
            operational control. Each component addresses specific business processes while contributing 
            to unified enterprise intelligence and reporting.
        </p>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/erp/dashboard">Dashboard</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Executive visibility into enterprise health through real-time dashboards aggregating data 
                    across all ERP functions. Key performance indicators (KPIs) update instantly, providing 
                    immediate awareness of operational status.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/erp/generalledger">General Ledger</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    The financial backbone of the ERP, recording every debit and credit across the chart 
                    of accounts. Native multi-currency support and automated posting ensure 
                    financial integrity and IFRS compliance.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/erp/accountspayable">Accounts Payable</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Comprehensive procurement-to-pay automation with 3-way matching, digitized invoice approval, 
                    and batch payment runs ensuring supplier relationships are maintained with precision.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/erp/accountsreceivable">Accounts Receivable</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Drive collection discipline with automated payment reminders, credit limit enforcement, 
                    and real-time debtor aging analysis to minimize bad debt and optimize working capital.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/erp/inventory">Inventory Management</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Centralized stock tracking across multiple locations with batch/serial numbering, 
                    automated reorder alerts, and scientific valuation methods (FIFO/WAC).
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/erp/procurement">Procurement / Purchasing</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Structured end-to-end purchasing from requisition to goods receipt. Multi-level approval chains 
                    and budget checks ensure procurement spend remains within authorized limits.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/erp/pointofsale">Point of Sale (POS)</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Retail transaction interface designed for Zimbabwe's multi-tender ecosystem with native 
                    ZIMRA fiscal device integration and mobile money payment reconciliation.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/erp/salesinvoicing">Sales & Invoicing</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Complete sales cycle management from quotation to tax-compliant invoice, supporting 
                    customer-specific price lists and promotional discount rules.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/erp/projectmanagement">Project Management</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Track project budgets, tasks, and resources with precise job costing. Bill time and 
                    materials with confidence, supported by real-time WIP valuation.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/erp/fixedassets">Fixed Assets</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Lifecycle management of capital assets from acquisition to disposal. Automated depreciation 
                    runs under IAS 16 and physical asset verification workflows.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/erp/budgeting">Budgeting & Forecasting</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Real-time financial planning connecting targets to actuals with variance analysis, 
                    rolling reforecasts, and multi-year strategic planning support.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/erp/reporting">Reporting & Analytics</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Consolidated IFRS-compliant financial statements with custom report builders, drilldown 
                    capabilities, and scheduled distribution to key stakeholders.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/erp/audit">Audit & Compliance</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Immutable change logs and structural segregation-of-duties (SOD) enforcement ensuring 
                    compliance with ISO 27001 and local regulatory audit requirements.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Integrated Financial Backbone</h2>
        <p>
            The general ledger forms the unbreakable core of the ERP system. Every operational transaction—from 
            a stock receipt in a remote warehouse to a retail sale at a POS terminal—posts automatically 
            to the ledger. This native integration ensures that your financial statements are always a 
            true reflection of your operational reality, eliminating the month-end reconciliation 
            delays that plague fragmented systems.
        </p>
        <p>
            Native multi-currency support enables organizations to operate comfortably in Zimbabwe's 
            dual-currency environment, maintaining transaction integrity in both USD and ZiG while 
            adhering to IFRS presentation standards.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Operation-Scale Inventory Control</h2>
        <p>
            Manage complex supply chains with multi-location stock tracking that provides real-time visibility 
            of inventory levels across the enterprise. Prevent stockouts through intelligent reorder 
            points and minimize shrinkage through rigorous lot and serial number tracking.
        </p>
        <p>
            The inventory module ensures that stock valuation is always accurate, utilizing FIFO or 
            Weighted Average Costing to feed the general ledger, providing the data needed for 
            precise margin analysis and procurement planning.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Compliance-First Architecture</h2>
        <p>
            Compliance is not an afterthought in Pindah ERP. From ZIMRA fiscalization at the POS to 
            IFRS-compliant financial reporting, the system is architected to meet the most 
            stringent regulatory and audit requirements. Immutable audit trails record every 
            system interaction, providing the transparency required by external auditors 
            and internal governance committees.
        </p>
        <p>
            Segregation of duties is enforced at the system level, preventing unauthorized 
            transactions and protecting organizational assets through structured approval 
            hierarchies and role-based access controls.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Project and Job Costing Precision</h2>
        <p>
            For project-based organizations, the ERP provides granular job costing that tracks time, 
            materials, and overheads against specific milestones and phases. WIP valuation 
            feeds the general ledger in real-time, ensuring that financial reporting accurately 
            reflects the progress of long-term projects and contracts.
        </p>
        <p>
            This level of detail enables managers to identify variances early, supporting 
            intervention strategies that protect project margins and ensure timely delivery.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

